{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "齋主弟子"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "香雲葢三稱畢，師云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大眾念佛，至靈前站定，念心經一卷，往生呪三遍畢，舉讚或說後文皆可。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大眾念佛，上座其座對靈前供接引佛一尊，香華供養，維那舉讚。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雲：來集。三稱畢，師拈香云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "香雲葢三稱畢，師與大眾齊座下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三稱，此係維那師舉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "往生呪三遍，蓮池會三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "維那師舉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念佛百聲，維那舉讚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蓮池會三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "維那師舉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師與大眾齊下座，旋遶念佛千聲已，至靈前收佛號，舉觀音、勢至、清淨大海眾菩薩，各三稱畢，念十大願"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念佛上座。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鳴尺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鳴尺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蓮池會三稱，　第一時佛事已畢，下座。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師與眾登座定，維那師舉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "接誦阿彌陀經一遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "往生呪三遍，蓮池會三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "維那師舉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念佛百聲，維那舉讚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蓮池會三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "維那師舉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下座，旋遶，念佛千聲已，至靈前。師舉觀音、勢至、清淨海。眾三稱畢，念後文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蓮池會三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師與眾登座定，維那師舉。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "接誦阿彌陀經一遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "接往生呪三遍，念蓮池會三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "維那師舉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念佛百聲，維那舉讚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蓮池會三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "維那師舉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下座，旋遶，念佛千聲已，至靈前。師舉觀音、勢至、清淨海。眾三稱畢，念後文。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "念佛登座。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某"}
